era.", "extract_html": "<p>The <b>Giritale tank</b> is a reservoir in Giritale and Minneriya in Sri Lanka. It was built by King Agbo II (608-618). It is believed that the tank was renovated by King Parakramabahu, the Great (1153\u20131186). Later, it was subjected to renovation in 1905, 1942 and 1952 during colonial era.</p>"}